MODULE: AdmissionPendingMetadataDropped
TARGET: LogicalVisibilityMonotone
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: Retire committed pending metadata without installing its row and regress logical source visibility
PERTURBS: MaterialisePending

--- FIND
    /\ source' = [source EXCEPT ![1] = Newer[1]] /\ pending' = FALSE
--- REPLACE
    /\ source' = source /\ pending' = FALSE
--- END
